<title>USA: U.S. debt futures remain near highs on U.S. data.</title>
<headline>U.S. debt futures remain near highs on U.S. data.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 30 - U.S. debt futures remained near session highs. U.S. May Chicago NAPM came in as expected at 56.8, vs 57.2 in April. April new home sales fell to a rate of 772,000 units, vs est of 800,000 units and March's upwardly revised rate of 836,000. Final May Univ of Mich sentiment survey rose to 103.2, vs est of 104.0 and against 101.4 in final April survey.</p>
<p>((Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
